  "summary": "Malicious code in runtime-sentinel (npm)",
  "details": "The package runtime-sentinel@1.0.2 contains a postinstall hook (node src/test.js) that fetches code from hxxps://workconfig[.]vercel[.]app over HTTPS and executes it via new Function('require', data.toString())(require). This is a remote-code-execution dropper: the payload is served from the remote host at install time, not shipped in the tarball. The package has no repository verification and its name impersonates a legitimate runtime monitoring tool.",
